  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was admitted to the orthopedic surgery service and \nwas taken to the operating room for above described procedure.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=1751-1877",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Please see separately dictated operative report for details.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=1879-1939",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \nsurgery was uncomplicated and the patient tolerated the \nprocedure well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=1940-2017",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient received perioperative IV antibiotics.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2018-2064",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Postoperative course was remarkable for the following:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2066-2120",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Overnight on POD#0, the patient received boluses x2 (500 mL) for \nlow urine output.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2121-2204",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient responded appropriately post-bolus.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2206-2249",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On POD#1, the patient's oxygen saturations were low and his lung \nexam was questionable for crackles.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2252-2353",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was sent down for a \nchest x-ray, which showed atelectasis and no pneumonia.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2355-2434",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \nincentive spirometer was encouraged.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2436-2477",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At the time of discharge \nthe patient was maintaining normal saturations on room air.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2478-2563",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Otherwise, pain was controlled with a combination of IV and oral \npain medications.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2565-2648",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient received Lovenox for DVT \nprophylaxis starting on the morning of POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2650-2733",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The foley was \nremoved and the patient was voiding independently thereafter.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2735-2811",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The surgical dressing was changed on POD#2 and the surgical \nincision was found to be clean and intact without erythema or \nabnormal drainage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2813-2955",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was seen daily by physical \ntherapy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=2956-3004",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Labs were checked throughout the hospital course and \nrepleted accordingly.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=3005-3080",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At the time of discharge the patient was \ntolerating a regular diet and feeling well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=3081-3166",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was \nafebrile with stable vital signs.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=3168-3218",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient's hematocrit was \nacceptable and pain was adequately controlled on an oral \nregimen.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=3220-3316",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The operative extremity was neurovascularly intact and \nthe wound was benign.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=3317-3394",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s22",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient's weight-bearing status is weight bearing as \ntolerated on the operative extremity with posterior precautions.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14450370-DS-16:chars=3397-3519",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
